<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-thompson1917-t1917-041-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Thompson (1917) radial-cordate leaf transformation claim T1917-041 — MorphoEval overall 62.6/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-28"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 fits the 8p radial-cordate family on synthetic parametric leaf pairs with strong in-sample R², but does not segment Thompson Fig. 359–360 ink outlines, perform Begonia specimen CV validation, parameter-regime sweeps, ablation controls, or formal KS tests. Overall 62.6/100 (faithfulness 58.0, reproducibility 73.2); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4; environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.x, matplotlib 3.x. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 72, Morphological realism / specimen match 48, Parameter expressivity 55, Morphometric validation 58, Source and data traceability 82, Code-to-model traceability 70, Reproducibility package 68. Output judged: docs/media/t1917_041_on_the_theory_of_transformatio_comparison.png: rendered output of thompson/claims/t1917-041_on-the-theory-of-transformations.py at f1d96f32ba3f00517c53e9cd007634306cc8d4f4, image/png, 393749 B, 1680×1120 px, artifact_sha256 793aa09dbe676a861b2f5465a6bd496f476cedd2f783241aa14fb38c8bd6b19d (sha256 793aa09dbe676a861b2f5465a6bd496f476cedd2f783241aa14fb38c8bd6b19d), spec_fingerprint 2874108b4c92e842aade03eb1a10b668c06797f3484cd9de80e369cfd15118ee. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 2874108b4c92e842aade03eb1a10b668c06797f3484cd9de80e369cfd15118ee; artifact_sha256: 793aa09dbe676a861b2f5465a6bd496f476cedd2f783241aa14fb38c8bd6b19d; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/thompson_1917/t1917-041/t1917_041_on_the_theory_of_transformatio_reference.json=557e1ed2a1934ad1...}." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/composer-2.5> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Digitize / segment Thompson Fig. 359–360 leaf ink outlines from IA page 752 and fit radial vs null models on extracted boundaries.",
        "remediation needed: Enable PASS2 parameter-regime k sweep, shuffle ablation control, and Begonia rex CV segmentation with RMSE/r/KS statistics.",
        "remediation needed: Write result.json verdict using real-specimen + figure metrics, not synthetic-only R²." ;
    pk:hasScore 6.26e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

